        "Bid Summary": {
          "value": "The Maryland State Treasurer\u2019s Office issued a Purchase Order Request for Proposals (PORFP #E20P4600040, solicitation BPM044557) for Dell Latitude 5550 laptops and Dell Thunderbolt 4 Dock (WD22TB4) with extended warranty. The solicitation calls for 30 units of each item, requires the laptops to be Microsoft Copilot ready, ENERGY STAR certified, and the contractor must be an authorized Dell reseller and provide a Mercury Affidavit. Proposals must be submitted electronically through the eMaryland Marketplace Advantage (eMMA) system by the closing date of 06/10/2024 02:00 PM EDT, and the award will be limited to certified small\u2011business vendors under the 2015 Master Contract 060B5400007. Additional requirements include delivery within 45 days of award, a 90\u2011day proposal validity, and compliance with the small\u2011business reserve (0 % SBR) and other security and documentation provisions.",
